# #6166. Pairs with BirthCloseHeld: the fence records on the leaf's marker the
# switch's stored birth hint rather than its own heads, so the leaf, which reads no
# shard bulk close once its own is recorded, may pass a record allocated between the
# switch's begin and its close without reading it.
MODULE: BirthCloseHeldLeafRecordsBirthHint
TARGET: BirthCloseHeld
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the leaf's own close records the birth hint instead of the fence's heads
PERTURBS: Close

--- FIND
    /\ leafClose' = IF closeHead' # closeHead /\ ~WithSkip THEN MaxN(leafClose, closeHead') ELSE leafClose
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the stored birth hint, not the fence's heads.
    /\ leafClose' = IF closeHead' # closeHead /\ ~WithSkip THEN MaxN(leafClose, hint) ELSE leafClose
--- END
